[00:24.30]1. We’re gathered together, Jehovah our God,
[00:32.24]Accepting your warm invitation.
[00:39.30]Your Word is a lamp that lights up our pathway,
[00:46.08]The source of divine education.
[00:53.70](Chorus)
[00:53.72]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[00:59.42]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[01:07.32]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[01:13.56]And make your law my principal delight.
[01:45.16]2. Unreachably high is your wisdom, O God;
[01:51.38]Your judgments we find reassuring.
[01:57.78]Your Word is a source of unending wonder;
[02:04.60]Your sayings of truth are enduring.
[02:11.44](Chorus)
[02:11.44]Teach me your ways, and make me understand;
[02:17.22]Incline my ear to hear your wise command.
[02:24.30]Cause me to walk in ways of truth and right,
[02:30.40]And make your law my principal delight.
